[487.97337, "o", "\r\n**CI diagnosis: cause 2 (stale base), High confidence**\r\n- The PR only adds 12 lines to `deploy/utils/README.md`. The failing test was `test_dump_docs_quotes_yaml11_ambiguous_strings` in `convert_api_version`.\r\n- The PR's merge base was `07a80bb`, which stopped quoting `y`, `n`, `Y` and `N` in converted manifests. Commit `367a899` on the base reverses it exactly.\r\n"]
